    "local": {
      "type": "local-area",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Most Lehi calls start the same way",
            "text": "<p>Lehi has grown faster than anywhere else in the county, and a lot of those homes were handed over with a small builder-grade slab off the back door and bare dirt everywhere else. The call we get is nearly always the same: finish the backyard. A proper <a href=\"/pages/concrete-patios\">patio</a>, <a href=\"/pages/concrete-walkways\">walkways</a> down both side yards, steps to get from the deck to the grass, and often a <a href=\"/pages/retaining-walls\">retaining wall</a> to hold the grade the builder left behind.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Decorative work, not just grey",
            "text": "<p>The patio at the top of this page is a Lehi backyard — a two-tone checkerboard stained into the slab, laid out on the diagonal and cut to the shape of the yard. Stain, integral color and stamped patterns are all poured by the same crew that does the flatwork, so the decorative work isn't subcontracted out to someone who turns up after we've gone. See <a href=\"/pages/decorative-concrete-patios\">decorative concrete</a> for the finishes we do.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "detail",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tight side yards are normal here",
            "text": "Lehi's newer lots sit close together. Where a truck can't reach, we pump or wheel it — a narrow side yard is a logistics problem, not a reason to say no."
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "detail",
          "settings": {
            "title": "We work around new landscaping",
            "text": "Sod, sprinklers and young trees usually go in before the concrete does. We protect what's there, plan the access route with you first, and leave the site clean."
          }
        },
        "b5": {
          "type": "detail",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Grade and drainage on a graded lot",
            "text": "Builder grading is set up to move water off the lot, not around a new patio. We slope the slab to keep that working rather than ponding water against your foundation."
          }
        }
      },
